  "id": "BIT-couchdb-2026-90799",
  "summary": "Apache CouchDB: Atom-table exhaustion in _changes sequences and _search bookmarks with specially crafted sequence values",
  "details": "Unsafe binary deserialisation in chttpd in Apache CouchDB 3.5.2 and below on all platforms allows an authenticated user to cause a denial of service via memory exhaustion.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.5.3, which fixes this issue.",
